Package: vsdm2-client
Version: [[version]]
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: openjdk-21-jre-headless | java21-runtime-headless, adduser
Maintainer: Service Health erx GmbH <info@service-health.de>
Homepage: https://www.service-health.de/
Description: VSDM 2.0 client application
 Spring Boot service that reads insurance master data (VSDM 2.0) via the
 Telematics Infrastructure, authenticating to the ZETA guard with an SMC-B
 held by the Konnektor. Serves HTTP on port 8083.
 .
 All settings are read from the environment file /etc/default/vsdm2-client.
